---
/**
 * Hero institucional da Home.
 * Não carrega ranking, modelos nem âncoras de oferta.
 * Heroes de /melhores/ e /blog/ ficam nos templates dessas páginas.
 */
---

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10 bg-ink" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
	<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-ink via-ink/95 to-brand-900" aria-hidden="true" />
	<div class="absolute -right-20 top-20 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-pop/10 blur-[100px]" aria-hidden="true" />
	<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
		<div class="max-w-3xl">
			<p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-on-ink-muted">Casa Prática Eletro</p>
			<h1
				id="hero-heading"
				class="font-display mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-on-ink-body sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"
			>
				Encontre o eletrodoméstico que faz sentido para você
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-on-ink-body sm:text-lg">
				Guias, comparativos e reviews para ajudar você a entender as opções, comparar modelos e tomar uma decisão de
				compra mais segura.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-8 flex w-full max-w-xl flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap">
				<a
					href="/melhores/"
					class="inline-flex min-h-[56px] items-center justify-center rounded-lg border-2 border-white/25 bg-cta px-7 py-4 text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide text-white shadow-[0_6px_20px_-4px_rgba(34,197,94,0.55)] ring-2 ring-white/25 transition duration-300 ease-out hover:bg-cta-hover"
				>
					Ver guias de compra
				</a>
				<a
					href="/blog/"
					class="inline-flex min-h-[56px] items-center justify-center rounded-lg border-2 border-zinc-100 bg-zinc-900 px-7 py-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-on-ink-body ring-1 ring-white/10 transition duration-300 ease-out hover:bg-zinc-800"
				>
					Ver artigos do blog
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
